<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Portal - Account Verification Email</title>
    <style>
        {

        {
            CSS_CONTENT
        }

        }</style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-card">
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="system-notice">Notice Type: System Generated Email Notification</div>
            <h1>🎓 University of Kelaniya</h1>
            <p>Campus Services Portal — Registrar Verification Office</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-body">
            <div class="body-title-row">
                <h2>Account Email Verification</h2>
                {{STATUS_BADGE}}
            </div>

            <p class="greeting-text">Dear <strong>{{FULL_NAME}}</strong>,</p>

            <p>Welcome to the University Campus Services Portal! Your account registration has been processed against the Registrar Master List records.</p>

            <table class="meta-table">
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label">Student Index No:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value-primary">{{INDEX_NUMBER}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label">Registered Email:</td>
                    <td class="meta-value-secondary">{{REGISTERED_EMAIL}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="meta-label">Faculty Unit:</td>
                    <td>{{FACULTY_NAME}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>To activate your portal login and complete account setup, please enter your single-use verification token:</p>

            <div class="token-box">
                <div class="token-title">Single-Use Activation Token</div>
                <div class="token-code">{{TOKEN}}</div>
            </div>

            <p class="expiry-text">⏰ This single-use verification token is valid until: <strong>{{EXPIRES_STR}}</strong>.</p>

            <div class="signoff-block">
                <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
                <p class="signoff-signature">Administrator.</p>
            </div>

            <hr class="divider" />
            <p class="disclaimer-text">If you did not initiate this registration request, please disregard this message or notify the IT Helpdesk.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="email-footer">
            <p class="footer-title">Campus Services Portal — University Registrar Office</p>
            <p>This is an automated system dispatch. Please do not reply directly to this email address.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
